# Keep the App Runner build context lean + reproducible (mirrors the gateway's
# clean-context build hygiene — AppleDouble ._* files break some builders).
.git
.github
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
._*
**/._*
.DS_Store
tests
docs
deploy
# NOTE: do NOT exclude README.md — pyproject `readme = "README.md"` makes the
# hatchling build read it, so excluding *.md breaks `uv sync`.
